      "voiceover_script": "Promotion has two parts. Advertising is a paid for communication with potential customers about a product to encourage them to buy it. Informative advertising explains features; persuasive advertising builds feeling and status. Social media, emails, leaflets and billboards show both. Sales promotions are incentives such as special offers, discounts, or reward schemes aimed at consumers to achieve short term increases in sales; vouchers join them. Information builds understanding, persuasion lifts desire, offers trigger action.",
